Q: does anybody know a library to add digital signature in the pdf in ios app? A: <p>I have used library 'SwiftSignatureView' , But we can retrieve the view as image and paste into our PDF. Here is the link .<br />
<a href="https://github.com/alankarmisra/SwiftSignatureView" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://github.com/alankarmisra/SwiftSignatureView</a></p>
<p>The cryptographic or digital signing might not work with this library. See if this approach can help you somewhere .</p>
<pre><code>import SwiftSignatureView

class SignatureVC: SwiftSignatureViewDelegate{
@IBOutlet weak var signatureView: SwiftSignatureView!


@IBAction func didTapOnSubmitSignature(_ sender: Any){
   let image = self.signatureView.signature
//Here you can paste this image in pdf.
}

